      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Part of the release of the 1.1 version was that the 1.0 version would be unaffected. So if you can do what you want with 1.0, then do so.\n\nBug tracker is a place to come to VRChat and carefully explain a bug. \n\nI think you should either try version 1.0, or make a forum thread if you are trying to do something that neither 1.0 or 1.1 will do.",
