  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Since gravity \"now acts as a ratio of how far the bones will rotate when at rest. A positive Pull is required for bones to move in the direction of gravity\" but gravity value ALSO still scales the strength of gravity, it seems that making hanging ribbons or similar features on an avatar (anything where you do NOT want the bones to return to rest position but still want them to be influenced by gravity) is now impossible. If this is not the case could you please reach out to me and inform me of how to achieve this implementation?",
